# Build context hygiene. The Dockerfile clones whisper.cpp itself at a pinned
# commit, so the local submodule copy (plus its 148 MB model and build tree)
# must stay out of the context or every build uploads ~1 GB for nothing.

.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
api/venv
# The image clones whisper.cpp at a pinned commit, so never send the local
# submodule checkout (source, build tree, and models) as build context.
api/whisper.cpp

# Frontend: not part of the API image. `web` is built and served separately.
web
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Docs and editor cruft
*.md
!api/README.md
Design Presentation Preset Configuration.pptx
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Training checkpoints (the exported adapter is kept)
api/ml/artifacts/muril-lora/checkpoint-*
